	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\n  Ratio = R36/(R72+R73+R36) = 2/(24.9+12.4+2) = 2/39.3 = 0.05089\n    at 50.4 V -> 2.565 V\n    at 56.0 V -> 2.850 V\n    clips at VREF+ = 3.3 V when Vbus = 64.8 V\n  Divider current at 50.4 V = 1.283 mA (continuous pack drain)\n  P(R72) = 41 mW, P(R73) = 20 mW\n  Rth = (R72+R73) || R36 = 1.90 k\n  tau = 190 us, fc = 838 Hz"
